  "title": "Data extraction quality check",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Data extraction quality check</h2><p>Evaluate a reporting extract before using it for financial analysis.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f1\">Number of source invoices missing before the join</label><input id=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f2\">Difference from the source total before the join</label><input id=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f3\">Additional overstatement caused by the duplicate invoice</label><input id=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f4\">Required remediation</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Correct joins and filters and reconcile counts and totals\">Correct joins and filters and reconcile counts and totals</option><option value=\"Accept the chart as reliable\">Accept the chart as reliable</option><option value=\"Ignore unmatched records\">Ignore unmatched records</option><option value=\"Assume all differences cancel\">Assume all differences cancel</option></select></div></section>",
